---
// src/components/Layanan.astro
// Layanan bisnis komersial
---

<section id="layanan" class="py-20 bg-dark text-white relative overflow-hidden">
  <!-- Background Decorative Elements -->
  <div
    class="absolute top-0 right-0 -mr-20 -mt-20 w-64 h-64 rounded-full bg-gold-600/20 blur-3xl"
    aria-hidden="true"
  ></div>
  <div
    class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 -ml-20 -mb-20 w-64 h-64 rounded-full bg-gold-600/20 blur-3xl"
    aria-hidden="true"
  ></div>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-4">
        Layanan Jasa Pembuatan Website & <span class="text-gold-400">Publikasi Jurnal</span>
      </h2>
      <div class="w-20 h-1 bg-gold-500 mx-auto rounded-full mb-6" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <p class="text-gray-300 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        Membantu sekolah, madrasah, perguruan tinggi, perusahaan, serta rekan akademisi (dosen dan
        mahasiswa) untuk memiliki platform digital modern dan meningkatkan kualitas publikasi ilmiah.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
      <!-- Layanan 1: Web Development -->
      <section class="bg-gray-800 border border-gray-700 rounded-2xl p-8 hover:border-gold-500 transition-colors">
        <div
          class="w-14 h-14 bg-gold-500/20 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-gold-400 text-2xl mb-6"
        >
          <i class="fa-solid fa-globe" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 text-white">Jasa Pembuatan Website Profesional</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-400 mb-6 text-sm italic">
          Menghadirkan website cepat, modern, mobile-friendly (responsif), dan teroptimasi SEO tinggi.
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-3">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-gray-300">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-gold-400" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            Website Sekolah, Madrasah, dan Pesantren
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-gray-300">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-gold-400" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            Website Kampus, Program Studi, & Jurnal
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-gray-300">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-gold-400" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            Website Profil Perusahaan (Company Profile)
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-gray-300">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-gold-400" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            Toko Online Integrasi Payment Gateway
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-gray-300">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-gold-400" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            Landing Page Bisnis & Portofolio Personal
          </li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Layanan 2: Journal Mentoring -->
      <section class="bg-gray-800 border border-gray-700 rounded-2xl p-8 hover:border-gold-500 transition-colors">
        <div
          class="w-14 h-14 bg-gold-500/20 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-gold-400 text-2xl mb-6"
        >
          <i class="fa-solid fa-file-pen" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 text-white">Pendampingan Jurnal Ilmiah</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-400 mb-6 text-sm italic">
          Bimbingan intensif penyusunan karya tulis ilmiah agar lolos di jurnal nasional terakreditasi SINTA.
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-3">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-gray-300">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-gold-400" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            Bimbingan Penulisan Berdasarkan Standar IMRAD
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-gray-300">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-gold-400" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            Pendampingan Penggunaan Reference Manager (Mendeley/Zotero)
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-gray-300">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-gold-400" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            Pendampingan Submit Jurnal & Respons Reviewer
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-gray-300">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-gold-400" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            Solusi Efektif Lolos Jurnal Nasional Terakreditasi
          </li>
        </ul>
      </section>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 text-center">
      <a
        href="https://wa.me/6282160052217"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener"
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 bg-gradient-to-r from-gold-500 to-gold-600 text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-full font-bold text-lg hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-gold-500/40 transition-all shadow-md"
        aria-label="Konsultasi gratis dengan Rizky Rinaldi via WhatsApp"
      >
        <i class="fa-solid fa-comments" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        Konsultasi Jasa Gratis Sekarang
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>